Released in the United States on February 14, 2008, by Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures, the film received mixed-to-negative reviews from critics, although the reviews
were better than those for its predecessor, but became a box office success, grossing $150.8 million worldwide against a production budget of $17.5 million.

